WEBVTT

00:01.040 --> 00:04.290
<i>Divine legend has it...</i>

00:04.290 --> 00:10.670
<i>...that once upon a time,</i>
<i>the ancient demons forged a magic sword...</i>

00:10.670 --> 00:12.670
<i>...to annihilate the gods.</i>

00:17.890 --> 00:19.430
Come, Zenetero.

00:27.060 --> 00:30.900
Those divine beasts...
I wonder how they got in here?

00:30.900 --> 00:33.150
It’s not as if they came in.

00:33.150 --> 00:36.160
To the gods,
that wall is a powerful curse.

00:36.910 --> 00:38.870
Um... meaning...?

00:39.780 --> 00:42.870
They must’ve snuck in before the wall was built.

00:43.330 --> 00:47.830
Makes sense. The wall had just
been built around this time, right?

00:48.670 --> 00:50.000
Could it be...

00:50.710 --> 00:53.340
...that that god named NousGalia...

00:54.340 --> 00:56.630
...is still here inside this forest?

00:56.630 --> 00:57.970
Rest assured.

00:58.720 --> 01:01.890
My master has ordered me to protect you.

01:01.890 --> 01:04.310
I shall remain by your side until
the threat is gone.

01:06.980 --> 01:11.900
Thanks. You’re stubborn, Shin,
but you can be sweet sometimes, too!

01:12.440 --> 01:16.910
If you feel that way towards me,
then it’s due to my master’s mercy.

01:18.780 --> 01:20.330
Leno!

01:20.700 --> 01:22.080
It’s Grandma.

01:22.080 --> 01:24.160
Grandma’s going to vanish soon!

01:24.160 --> 01:26.000
She’s about to expire.

01:29.000 --> 01:30.840
Let’s all see her off.

01:34.120 --> 01:38.540
LIKE A SINGLE STROKE OF A SWORD

01:35.340 --> 01:36.510
Grandma...

01:39.010 --> 01:42.010
So glad to see you back, Leno.

01:43.010 --> 01:43.970
Well, well.

01:44.850 --> 01:49.480
I can see that we have a sweet little guest today!

01:49.940 --> 01:51.610
What’s your name?

01:51.610 --> 01:53.190
Anoshu Polticoal.

01:53.530 --> 01:57.030
I’m the Great Tree Spirit Migelonov.

01:57.280 --> 02:01.950
A spirit who bestows the wisdom
to survive great wars upon humans.

02:03.240 --> 02:04.830
Take a leaf for yourselves.

02:05.120 --> 02:09.790
I’m granting you all the wisdom to fight.

02:12.630 --> 02:17.510
Ah... looks like you have no need for it.

02:17.510 --> 02:19.510
I hear that you’ll soon cease to exist.

02:19.510 --> 02:21.510
Have your rumors and lore expired?

02:21.850 --> 02:26.720
Apparently, there’s something that I
can teach you, other than battle.

02:27.270 --> 02:31.600
There’s another situation that calls
for a spirit to expire.

02:32.020 --> 02:36.820
And that is when the spirit
has betrayed her rumors and lore.

02:37.240 --> 02:42.820
My lore is about me granting humans
the wisdom to battle demons.

02:43.030 --> 02:49.290
But I focused on the wisdom
for humans and demons to coexist.

02:50.250 --> 02:51.080
The leaves!

02:51.540 --> 02:54.130
Grandma! I’m so sorry!

02:54.130 --> 02:56.630
It’s all because I was so selfish!

02:57.260 --> 03:02.140
The Great Tree from a great war
is bound to be forgotten after it’s all over.

03:02.140 --> 03:05.810
Either way, I was always destined to expire.

03:06.310 --> 03:12.190
Leno, the day will come when you’ll have
to make that choice yourself.

03:12.190 --> 03:13.020
What?

03:13.400 --> 03:15.690
Either protect your rumors and lore...

03:15.690 --> 03:19.240
Or else betray them,
and protect what’s precious to you.

03:19.780 --> 03:22.610
That’s every Spirit’s fate.

03:23.700 --> 03:27.290
When you’re feeling lost,
you should listen to your heart.

03:27.620 --> 03:31.290
It’s not as if Spirits
are ruled over by their lore.

03:31.830 --> 03:34.920
Your heart will always belong to you.

03:35.960 --> 03:38.090
Grandma...

03:40.380 --> 03:43.550
You must protect whomever
it is that you wish to protect.

03:43.550 --> 03:46.140
I myself am satisfied.

03:46.140 --> 03:49.140
Because it won’t be long
before we know peace.

03:49.140 --> 03:50.730
I’m sure of it.

03:55.020 --> 03:56.230
I am at a loss.

03:58.190 --> 04:03.360
I wanted to stop your tears,
but I don’t know what I should say.

04:06.490 --> 04:10.830
Hey, Shin. Did the Demon King
order you to comfort me?

04:13.080 --> 04:19.670
Don’t worry. I don’t cry when I’m sad.
Because my tears become Spirits!

04:27.220 --> 04:31.350
When your children are being born,
it’s better to cry tears of joy!

04:35.480 --> 04:36.440
Whoa!

04:37.520 --> 04:39.650
That is... huge.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.700
Is this...

04:43.700 --> 04:48.490
I found a lovely rumor, you know.
About a school for peaceful times.

04:48.700 --> 04:52.000
Where an old grandpa of an instructor
teaches you all sorts of things!

04:52.500 --> 04:58.330
A new member of our family...
this is the Great Tree Teacher, Enyunien!

05:00.920 --> 05:06.130
Violence is forbidden inside this tree,
so no worries if the divine beasts attack.

05:06.470 --> 05:09.510
So you’re able to give birth
to Spirits at will, Leno.

05:09.850 --> 05:13.020
I may be the Great Spirit Mother,
but I can’t do it at will.

05:13.020 --> 05:16.810
It’s more like my emotions spill out, I guess?

05:16.810 --> 05:19.900
Some Spirits are born without
having anything to do with me.

05:21.070 --> 05:22.980
I bet it’s the same for you, Lena.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.360
Uh-huh.

05:24.860 --> 05:28.410
Will you be staying here
in Aharthern for a while, Anoshu?

05:28.410 --> 05:31.030
We’re hoping to impose on you,
if you don’t mind.

05:31.030 --> 05:34.330
Fine by me! We don’t get
many traveling entertainers here,

05:34.330 --> 05:36.290
so I think everyone will be thrilled!

05:36.290 --> 05:37.580
I owe you one.

05:37.580 --> 05:39.580
Shin, come with me!

05:45.170 --> 05:48.970
Lay, Misha. I want you
to keep an eye on those two.

05:48.970 --> 05:50.890
There’s something I need to check out.

05:50.890 --> 05:51.930
- Okay.
- Gotcha.

05:53.560 --> 05:57.560
Hmm, around 100 books?
That’s still not a lot.

05:57.560 --> 06:04.030
Sorry about that.
I’m still not quite ready to start teaching.

06:04.030 --> 06:07.110
Well, let’s search for it, anyway.
Zeshia?

06:07.820 --> 06:09.820
Try to find a green book.

06:09.820 --> 06:12.080
It contains a passage about Fran,
the Love Fairy.

06:12.620 --> 06:16.080
Just leave it to me... all right?

06:17.290 --> 06:23.540
Fran... she’s the Spirit who gives shape
to unrequited love, and brings people together, right?

06:23.540 --> 06:27.420
That’s right. There was a book
with a missing page in this forest.

06:28.010 --> 06:32.260
<i>I figured that in this era, we could see</i>
<i>the book before the page was torn out.</i>

06:33.050 --> 06:35.390
I’ll watch over Zeshia.

06:35.390 --> 06:37.180
If anything comes up,
I’ll let you know.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.730
I’m counting on you.

06:39.980 --> 06:44.020
Shin, what were you doing to do
when you were done protecting me?

06:44.320 --> 06:49.280
There’s no point in living in an era
where I have no master to serve.

06:49.280 --> 06:52.740
I will follow my lord,
and be reincarnated 2,000 years from now.

06:53.530 --> 07:00.210
I see. Then I guess that some good
has come out of having gods hiding in this forest.

07:00.210 --> 07:01.250
Why would that be?

07:01.960 --> 07:04.670
Because I can play
with you a little longer!

07:17.890 --> 07:19.770
Okay, Shin. Guess what this is!

07:22.480 --> 07:23.810
I have no idea.

07:23.810 --> 07:27.900
They’re called tear-flowers.
They’re flowers that have absorbed my tears.

07:28.320 --> 07:30.990
Are these the ones that bore
the Great Tree just now?

07:30.990 --> 07:36.660
Yes. If tear-flowers bear fruit without withering,
they can transform rumors and lore into Spirits.

07:37.240 --> 07:40.910
That’s why you need to suffuse them with love,
so they don’t dry up.

07:42.120 --> 07:43.330
Like this, see?

07:48.340 --> 07:51.010
All right! And now...

07:52.800 --> 07:54.050
Let’s see you try it, Shin!

07:55.300 --> 07:55.970
Here!

07:55.970 --> 07:57.050
Why must I do it?

07:57.390 --> 08:02.640
Well, I just think that you should interact more
with living creatures, and with life.

08:02.640 --> 08:04.770
I’m sure you’ll enjoy it!

08:06.440 --> 08:09.480
I’ve interacted with lives
more times than I can count.

08:09.690 --> 08:11.650
That’s not what I’m talking about!

08:11.650 --> 08:13.200
Never mind that... go on!

08:15.030 --> 08:17.070
I see that I have no other choice.

08:23.710 --> 08:26.500
Hold on a second!
That’s no good, Shin!

08:26.500 --> 08:29.840
Love is an important part
of raising tear-flowers, okay?

08:29.840 --> 08:30.710
Love.

08:31.210 --> 08:33.670
Smile. Start by giving me a smile!

08:36.970 --> 08:39.390
Come on, I said love, all right?

08:39.640 --> 08:42.730
Love! Can you take this
a little more seriously?

08:42.730 --> 08:44.100
I know nothing about love.

08:44.100 --> 08:47.560
Now, now, that kind of stubborn attitude
isn’t going to cut it!

08:47.560 --> 08:50.480
After all, Shin, you do like
the Demon King, Anos, don’t you?

08:51.610 --> 08:55.530
So all you have to do is feel that love
for the Demon King as you water the flowers!

08:55.950 --> 08:59.080
The Demon King is the one
who saved my life.

08:59.080 --> 09:02.290
I served him not out of love,
but out of gratitude.

09:02.750 --> 09:07.080
This body of mine has always been,
and always will be, a sword and nothing more.

09:07.380 --> 09:08.580
Does that mean—

09:08.580 --> 09:09.790
Oh, there he is!

09:10.130 --> 09:13.170
- There’s the old man!
- Play with us!

09:13.170 --> 09:15.930
- Old Man Sword!
- Let’s all play together!

09:17.180 --> 09:21.180
You saved them just now,
so they’ve grown attached to you. See?

09:23.930 --> 09:27.560
Hey, let’s play!
Let’s play tag with all of the Spirits!

09:27.980 --> 09:30.770
You guys! If you can stay out
of Shin’s clutches for one minute,

09:30.770 --> 09:33.570
he says he’ll do anything you say!

09:34.070 --> 09:36.070
Ready, set... go!

09:39.870 --> 09:42.080
I shall sit this one out.

09:42.080 --> 09:48.250
Oh? So the Demon King Anos’s right-hand man
doesn’t think he can catch fairies.

09:48.250 --> 09:50.080
I didn’t know that!

09:50.080 --> 09:51.920
That I cannot ignore.

10:13.480 --> 10:15.650
You’re like a Spirit, aren’t you, Shin?

10:16.280 --> 10:17.950
What do you mean by that?

10:17.950 --> 10:21.030
You’re the Sword Spirit
who’s forgotten what love is.

10:21.030 --> 10:22.580
Seems like one would exist.

10:23.530 --> 10:25.160
All right, one minute!

10:27.120 --> 10:29.170
Did I not capture them all?

10:29.170 --> 10:30.370
No, not all of them.

10:31.130 --> 10:33.290
Because there’s still one Spirit left.

10:33.630 --> 10:35.300
That’s me!

10:39.090 --> 10:40.890
I shall refrain from making any excuses.

10:40.890 --> 10:44.100
Okay, what should I have you do, Shin?

10:44.100 --> 10:48.390
<i>Lady Leno? Shin? You have a guest.</i>

10:48.390 --> 10:49.020
Who is it?

10:49.310 --> 10:52.980
<i>He calls himself the Blaze Death King Erdomaid.</i>

10:53.230 --> 10:56.690
<i>He says he has something</i>
<i>to tell you about the gods.</i>

11:06.120 --> 11:07.370
What do you want?

11:07.370 --> 11:10.250
Hey, don’t give me that scowl.

11:10.580 --> 11:13.130
I did bring you some good news, you know.

11:13.130 --> 11:16.840
I know where the Heavenly Father
God NousGalia is.

11:18.050 --> 11:22.180
He came to me with a proposal the other day.

11:22.180 --> 11:23.840
What he’s after...

11:25.140 --> 11:28.220
...is you! Great Mother Spirit!

11:28.890 --> 11:33.810
NousGalia is determined to use your womb
to give birth to the Child of God!

11:34.150 --> 11:38.030
In order to kill the Demon King Anos
2,000 years from now.

11:38.360 --> 11:40.150
How did you answer?

11:40.150 --> 11:43.280
Needless to say,
I expressed my interest.

11:50.330 --> 11:52.580
No wonder you’re
the Demon King’s right-hand man!

11:52.580 --> 11:55.250
To think that he has someone
of your caliber serving him.

11:55.580 --> 11:59.920
The Demon King Anos is one popular man!

12:00.300 --> 12:03.430
That said, you should know
as well as anyone!

12:03.430 --> 12:06.680
That the Demon King has a fatal flaw.

12:06.970 --> 12:09.560
My lord has not a single flaw.

12:09.720 --> 12:12.850
Right. That’s right!

12:12.850 --> 12:15.230
That itself is his flaw!

12:15.230 --> 12:17.860
The Demon King of Tyranny has no flaws.

12:17.860 --> 12:22.780
He’s so bereft of flaws that
the Demon King Anos has no enemies.

12:22.780 --> 12:25.410
But enemies are what he needs.

12:25.410 --> 12:29.790
If he hopes to become stronger than he is now,
and to become the true Demon King!

12:30.240 --> 12:32.250
That’s what I want to see!

12:33.370 --> 12:35.620
What is that guy talking about?

12:35.620 --> 12:37.960
Erdomaid’s never grown up, see.

12:38.500 --> 12:42.800
I stroked him just once, and ever since then,
he’s always provoking me.

12:43.130 --> 12:45.800
Since he has some inexplicable hopes for me.

12:45.800 --> 12:47.470
What do you think?

12:47.470 --> 12:48.600
He’s creepy.

12:48.600 --> 12:49.760
Isn’t he?

12:50.350 --> 12:54.060
Not to mention, even after defeat,
he keeps whooping it up,

12:54.060 --> 12:55.230
so you can’t snuff him out.

12:57.190 --> 13:02.070
Which is why I am always
the Demon King’s enemy, no matter what.

13:02.690 --> 13:05.610
But that doesn’t make me
an ally of the gods, either!

13:05.610 --> 13:09.700
Will the Child of God really become
a worthy opponent of the Demon King?

13:09.700 --> 13:14.160
No, I have my doubts.
I can’t shake off my doubts.

13:14.540 --> 13:18.170
That’s why I’m informing you
about NousGalia’s scheme!

13:18.710 --> 13:23.090
You people need to go all out
and stop the Child of God from being born!

13:23.090 --> 13:28.430
If its birth can’t be stopped by
the Demon King’s right-hand man and a Great Spirit...

13:28.430 --> 13:33.810
...then the Child of God must be
an opponent worthy of taking on the Demon King!

13:34.230 --> 13:39.190
Until that moment arrives,
the Blaze Death King will be your ally!

13:41.320 --> 13:43.860
Shin, this man is crazy.

13:44.280 --> 13:47.490
Please pay him no mind.
This is par for the course.

13:48.320 --> 13:51.160
In short, if we can prevent
the birth of the Child of God,

13:51.160 --> 13:53.580
he will be disappointed and lose interest.

13:53.910 --> 13:56.870
What? I knew that you’d understand!

13:59.080 --> 14:01.880
Take me to where NousGalia is.

14:04.300 --> 14:05.340
Here?

14:05.340 --> 14:06.380
Yes.

14:06.380 --> 14:08.300
I can’t even sense his presence.

14:08.510 --> 14:11.970
That’s because the gods conform
to the rules of order.

14:11.970 --> 14:15.600
For him to appear,
conditions must be met.

14:18.270 --> 14:21.110
Now, then... come to the center of the spring.

14:31.370 --> 14:34.700
The Heavenly Father God NousGalia
is the order that produces gods.

14:34.950 --> 14:36.950
In other words,
the condition is...

14:37.910 --> 14:38.910
This.

14:46.010 --> 14:47.920
It’s the Blaze Death Hourglass.

14:48.300 --> 14:53.390
When every grain of sand has fallen,
the life of the cursed one ends.

14:55.220 --> 14:56.600
Just what are you trying to do?

14:57.140 --> 15:00.440
The Great Spirit Mother Leno is the womb
that will give birth to the Child of God.

15:00.940 --> 15:04.860
If I try to kill her,
he will show up.

15:04.860 --> 15:07.650
I doubt that you can trick him into appearing.

15:10.400 --> 15:13.740
But of course I’m going
to try my best to kill her!

15:13.740 --> 15:17.410
If she ends up perishing for real,
then so be it!

15:23.250 --> 15:25.170
You’re the Demon King’s right-hand man!

15:26.090 --> 15:28.550
Since she’s the womb of the Child of God,

15:28.550 --> 15:34.600
there should be no reason to risk so much
to protect this threat to your master!

15:35.180 --> 15:37.180
The rationale of the weak.

15:42.310 --> 15:50.320
My lord isn’t so weak that he must expose her life
to danger to protect himself.

16:05.210 --> 16:07.750
Potent... powerful...

16:08.130 --> 16:09.800
A juggernaut!

16:09.800 --> 16:12.300
I can see why you’re
the Demon King’s right-hand man!

16:12.300 --> 16:15.470
Otherwise, this would be no fun at all!

16:20.390 --> 16:21.850
The power of the gods?

16:22.100 --> 16:23.940
That’s right!

16:23.940 --> 16:27.900
I lent my body to the wounded NousGalia!

16:28.110 --> 16:31.650
I thought that he’d be forced
to emerge once his host died.

16:31.650 --> 16:34.280
Looks like I was spot on!

16:34.280 --> 16:35.910
You mean you planned all this?

16:36.200 --> 16:40.290
Yes. Whether it was Leno who nearly died,
or me being killed by you...

16:40.290 --> 16:42.710
Either way, the god would emerge!

16:42.710 --> 16:45.670
There was always the risk
that I’d perish myself,

16:45.670 --> 16:48.790
but isn’t gambling big what makes
it all so beautiful?

16:48.960 --> 16:50.420
Now, then, if you please, come out...

16:50.420 --> 16:52.340
Heavenly Father God, NousGalia!

16:52.340 --> 16:54.090
Show us what divine power looks like!

16:54.430 --> 16:59.930
Otherwise, the Blaze Death King
will take over your power, lock, stock, and—

17:15.360 --> 17:18.030
A god’s word is absolute.

17:18.030 --> 17:22.040
You foolish demons,
bow down before—

17:22.540 --> 17:26.460
The only person I’ll ever bow down to
is my lord, and no one else.

17:26.830 --> 17:28.790
You thought you were joining hands
with the Blaze Death King,

17:28.790 --> 17:30.630
but were you off the mark?

17:35.420 --> 17:38.760
All is proceeding according
to the gods’ orders.

17:39.220 --> 17:42.220
Show respect to the gods...
and fear them.

17:43.680 --> 17:44.850
Shin!

17:48.480 --> 17:52.230
What do you expect to accomplish
with that wounded body of yours?

17:53.230 --> 17:56.820
How arrogant of you,
you evil god-killing sword.

17:57.950 --> 18:01.910
So after being taken in by the Demon King,
you’ve gained a human-like soul, eh?

18:02.490 --> 18:06.750
But the void that’s filled your heart
will never be filled.

18:07.250 --> 18:10.000
I understand you wish
to be reincarnated, but...

18:10.710 --> 18:14.300
No matter how many times you’re reborn,
no matter how fervently you wish it,

18:14.300 --> 18:15.880
your struggle will only be futile.

18:16.220 --> 18:22.760
Because the emotion known as love doesn’t exist
in your heart, in your source.

18:24.770 --> 18:26.730
How dare you speak like that!

18:26.730 --> 18:32.270
Yes, Shin may be surly and stubborn,
but he’s way more kind-hearted than you!

18:34.980 --> 18:37.900
I see that you have no clue,
Great Spirit Leno.

18:38.700 --> 18:41.910
So let me enlighten your ignorant soul
with divine wisdom.

18:42.240 --> 18:46.330
His source actually isn’t that of a demon’s.

18:46.330 --> 18:48.120
He’s a magic sword.

18:50.250 --> 18:53.000
Shin Reglia, the evil god-killing sword.

18:53.000 --> 18:58.170
Eons ago, the demons’ forebears created him
in order to battle the gods.

18:58.550 --> 19:03.050
Its wielder was granted magic powers,
and the sword assumed a demon’s body.

19:03.050 --> 19:06.180
But even if he acquired a body!
Even if he gained his own will!

19:06.180 --> 19:08.560
Love is the one thing he can never possess!

19:08.850 --> 19:10.230
And of course not.

19:10.230 --> 19:14.520
How can a magic sword created
to fight even harbor love?

19:14.820 --> 19:17.900
No matter how much he seeks
or longs for another’s heart,

19:17.900 --> 19:22.360
that half-completed heard will always
be consumed by emptiness for all eternity.

19:22.360 --> 19:25.410
At the end of the day,
a magic sword is a magic sword.

19:26.910 --> 19:31.710
My body has always been, and always will be...
nothing but a sword.

19:34.420 --> 19:38.670
But you should be thankful,
evil god-killing sword.

19:38.960 --> 19:42.590
What you’ve sought eternally
but can never acquire...

19:43.140 --> 19:49.930
Those of us who manipulate order
can grant it to you.

19:51.310 --> 19:55.730
Raise the Child of God who will be borne
from the womb of the Great Spirit Leno.

19:56.020 --> 19:59.280
The order of the world will destroy the Demon King.

19:59.280 --> 20:00.240
Unfortunately...

20:03.450 --> 20:06.070
I have no need for love.

20:06.370 --> 20:09.490
Like a single stroke of a sword,
this body...

20:14.790 --> 20:17.170
A god’s word is absolute.

20:17.170 --> 20:20.880
You people will never escape order—

20:21.340 --> 20:25.890
I will serve my lord for all eternity.

20:25.890 --> 20:27.850
Along with the emptiness in my heart.

20:32.600 --> 20:34.140
Did he get away?

20:36.690 --> 20:37.730
Let’s go.

20:40.780 --> 20:44.820
Shin. Thank you for protecting me yet again!

20:45.240 --> 20:46.110
Also...

20:47.530 --> 20:48.780
I’m sorry.

20:49.740 --> 20:51.080
What are you talking about?

20:51.540 --> 20:55.750
For telling you to be more serious
about watering the tear-flowers.

20:55.750 --> 20:56.830
I’m so sorry.

20:57.080 --> 21:00.590
Rest assured.
As I would never be hurt by that.

21:01.130 --> 21:03.720
But he said you were empty, Shin.

21:04.300 --> 21:05.180
That’s not a big deal.

21:05.550 --> 21:10.140
He said you were empty!
I think that’s a pretty big deal!

21:14.770 --> 21:17.310
I’ll teach you what love is.

21:18.520 --> 21:20.070
I’m not sure what your purpose is.

21:20.320 --> 21:24.950
Because if you hadn’t protected me,
you could’ve gained love, Shin!

21:25.400 --> 21:27.740
No need for you to brood over this.

21:28.120 --> 21:33.040
Just as that god said,
there’s no love in my source.

21:33.040 --> 21:37.290
No, no... I’m sure that you have
a soul, too, Shin.

21:37.290 --> 21:39.750
It’s just a little hard to find.

21:40.420 --> 21:43.510
I’m going to give it my all,
so stay with me, okay?

21:45.090 --> 21:45.760
Is that...

21:46.680 --> 21:48.840
An order to protect you?

21:49.340 --> 21:53.180
That would be all right, too.
If it means that you’ll do as I say.

21:53.180 --> 21:53.970
Understood.

23:35.660 --> 23:39.980
THE LAND OF DEMONS WITHOUT A DEMON KING

23:36.990 --> 23:39.290
<i>The Land of Demons Without a Demon King.</i>
